# Quality

- Prefer strict, explicit types; avoid `any` and unsafe casts.
- Stay DRY: search existing `src/lib` and scenes before inventing helpers.
- When you change or add a recurring pattern, update `docs/HOW_WE_DO_IT.md` in the same change.
- Done means `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, and `npm run test` are green.

